     "title": "Weight regain and cardiometabolic effects after withdrawal of semaglutide: The STEP 1 trial extension, Diabetes, Obesity and Metabolism, 2022",
     "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35441470/"
    },
